  logText: This spherical structure initially appeared to be a part of a larger building,
    but a deeper analysis of its interior seems to suggest that's not the case. Its
    design actually indicates that it might have been used for housing, since it
    has features like insulated walls.  A spherical house is not what I was expecting,
    and especially not one so deep underground. I'm hoping to encounter more in better
    conditions.
